GateCloseDelay= for GAGATE_A (visual close timer).

Retail rulesmd.ini documents GateCloseDelay= as "time, in minutes, to delay
before closing a gate after it has opened"; GAGATE_A sets .2 (12 s = 180
logic ticks at 15/s). The sim already holds allied gate cells passable for
allied movers (open_gates_for), so the only place the missing delay shows is
the presentation gate, which closed 15 ticks after the last friendly unit
left. BldRules now carries the parsed delay and the gate block uses it;
absent/unparseable keeps the historical 15-tick close. Pure; no save change.

